0..67 Comment "//! `cancel-base` gives the task protocol for cancellation sources."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..150 Comment "//! A task sends its note on `Join`. A cancellation point is an operation that"
151..228 Comment "//! a capability scope answers. A cancellation clause resumes its scope once."
229..307 Comment "//! The clause can abandon that scope. The clause cancels an abandoned end for"
308..321 Comment "//! its peer."
322..325 Comment "//!"
326..404 Comment "//! Each cancellation source imports `Cancel`. The checker uses `Join` to type"
405..422 Comment "//! a parent end."
423..426 Comment "//!"
427..492 Comment "//! - cites: [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]"
493..496 Comment "//!"
497..663 Comment "//! [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3290341 \"Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova, Exceptional Asynchronous Session Types\""
665..741 Comment "/// A task: the protocol its end carries back to the parent, and the path it"
742..752 Comment "/// reads."
